  "artifact_bundle": {
    "schema_version": "research-decision-artifact-bundle-v1",
    "artifacts": [
      {
        "artifact_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
        "identity": {
          "scope_type": "security",
          "scope_key": "600519",
          "artifact_type": "research_case",
          "schema_version": "c3-v1",
          "as_of": "2026-10-11",
          "available_at": "2026-10-11T08:21:50.762534+00:00"
        },
        "canonical_payload": "{\"as_of\":\"2026-10-11\",\"blockers\":[\"仅认可历史财务与条件剩余收益范围；中性主估值、正常化盈利及金融尾部审阅未获准入\",\"本候选优势期和全资本衰减未获主模型批准\",\"原文独立解释已形成；重大性、当前模型有效性和估值批准仍未准入\",\"pending_economic_model_review\",\"pending_complete_event_materiality_review\"],\"counter_evidence\":[{\"evidence_refs\":[\"assumption_diagnostic\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"现有假设诊断将路径限定为强衰减压力情景，不能代替中性主估值。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"cninfo:1225475868\"],\"kind\":\"fact\",\"text\":\"扣非TTM使用年报加本期半年报减上年同期；不是跨周期正常化盈利批准。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"cninfo:1225431263\",\"independent-announcement-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"fact\",\"text\":\"7月18日限定产品渠道提价在H1期末之后，前瞻盈利影响尚未量化。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"cninfo:1225475863\",\"cninfo:1225475868\",\"independent-announcement-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"财务公司存款与合并现金流不能直接视为普通股可分配现金；分配假设仍未批准。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"profit-adjustment-bridge-20261008\",\"profit-adjustment-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"非经常性归母桥已对平，扣非基准不能再扣同一金融收益；信用减值本期为正利润贡献，以前期间所得税调整为净利增益，逐项税后归母及重叠仍未知。税桥打印分项与披露合计差0.01元，原数与差额均保留。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"parent-distribution-capital-bridge-20261008\",\"parent-distribution-capital-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"H1母公司现金及等价物下降234.75亿元，期初847.31亿元、期末612.56亿元；已执行派息350.33亿元及回购28.80亿元分别核对，不把库存股注销再算现金支出。历史现金缓冲不能证明未来75%派息；两只基金未实缴合计60亿元，付款时点未知。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"operating-mechanism-evidence-20261008\",\"operating-mechanism-research-20261008\",\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"cninfo:1225475868\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"H1成本同比+21.81%高于营收+1.47%，合并毛利率下降1.7441个百分点；FY销售费率4.2961%高于比较期3.2998%。收入韧性没有自动变成利润增长。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"operating-mechanism-evidence-20261008\",\"operating-mechanism-research-20261008\",\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"cninfo:1225475868\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"FY直营收入+12.96%而直营成本+31.07%，披露直营毛利率下降0.75个百分点；H1预收款下降60.31%含营销和预付款政策变化，既不能用渠道迁移证明增量需求，也不能将预收下降机械当成需求崩塌。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"forward-path-independent-review-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"独立重算确认：后五年全资本ROE衰减使第五年利润再下降52.65%/65.84%/75.35%，不是仅新增资本低回报；75%分配只适用于显式十年，终端实际约74.03%/70.40%/65.60%。压力路径不能用作中性合理价。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"financial-scope-independent-review-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"受限准备金两表期末/期初分别差349.29万元/370.98万元，原因未识别；原值分别保留，不重复扣现金，不能据此认证精确可分配自由现金。财务范围认可只支持历史及条件研究，不批准金融尾部、未来分配或中性主估值。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"pending-economic-proposal\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"毛利和扣非已走弱；财报不证明十年稳定盈利，全资本衰减仍未分账识别。\"}],\"evidence_refs\":[{\"availability_basis\":\"date_only_conservative_next_day_bound\",\"available_at\":\"2026-04-17T16:00:00+00:00\",\"id\":\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"path\":\"runtime/historical-filing-index/20260909T033444358365Z/pdfs/600519-1225114741.pdf\",\"sha256\":\"474905deeaf0f875fc0a1b097a626c0c7852c427faadc5d7fc7816cbf45ea288\",\"source_url\":\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-04-17/1225114741.PDF\",\"timestamp_precision\":\"date\"},{\"availability_basis\":\"date_only_conservative_next_day_bound\",\"available_at\":\"2026-08-15T16:00:00+00:00\",\"id\":\"cninfo:1225475868\",\"path\":\"runtime/historical-filing-index/20260909T033444358365Z/pdfs/600519-1225475868.pdf\",\"sha256\":\"0e10aa26be46b1cf3cd03f06e834c7fb98d5dd0d661b96f8fddd4af7e846a4f6\",\"source_url\":\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-08-15/1225475868.PDF\",\"timestamp_precision\":\"date\"},{\"id\":\"current_model\",\"path\":\"runtime/company-research/600519-consolidated-parent-equity-residual-income-current-20261008T090506Z/evidence.json\",\"sha256\":\"5a594b3b80e75aa5a7e880ad32506ae5d66b71cf39ed5aee9157dcff57fa803a\"},{\"id\":\"timing_policy\",\"path\":\"runtime\\\\company-research\\\\600519-current-equity-policy-staged-20261008T090506Z\\\\policy.json\",\"sha256\":\"b9006a70f91402b9532be01228dd01a495c9c84d1b0784a83436b88437320c88\"},{\"id\":\"scope_review\",\"path\":\"runtime/company-research/600519-current-equity-scope-review-20261008T090507Z/evidence.json\",\