t a channel year-on-year growth rate.\",\"Revenue per tonne is an aggregate mix proxy, not SKU realized price or immediate saleable aged inventory.\",\"TTM selected lines are not EBIT, NOPAT or normalized parent profit: taxes/surcharges, finance and other lines are absent.\",\"Contract liabilities reflect disclosed prepayment-policy and sales-mode changes, not a direct demand measurement.\",\"July SKU/channel price changes cannot be applied to all revenue without net-realization and volume evidence.\",\"Historical margins and channel changes support bounded hypotheses, not certain future pricing power or moat duration.\"],\"sources\":[{\"id\":\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"path\":\"runtime/historical-filing-index/20260909T033444358365Z/pdfs/600519-1225114741.pdf\",\"sha256\":\"474905deeaf0f875fc0a1b097a626c0c7852c427faadc5d7fc7816cbf45ea288\",\"source_url\":\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-04-17/1225114741.PDF\"},{\"id\":\"cninfo:1225475868\",\"path\":\"runtime/historical-filing-index/20260909T033444358365Z/pdfs/600519-1225475868.pdf\",\"sha256\":\"0e10aa26be46b1cf3cd03f06e834c7fb98d5dd0d661b96f8fddd4af7e846a4f6\",\"source_url\":\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-08-15/1225475868.PDF\"}],\"symbol\":\"600519\"},\"ordinary_shares\":\"1250081601\",\"parent_distribution_capital_research_binding\":{\"id\":\"parent-distribution-capital-bridge-20261008\",\"path\":\"runtime/d2-economic-research-20261008/parent-distribution-capital-bridge-v1.json\",\"sha256\":\"34cf0f4ac76a6fd2e2b6bd0cfe56500c270371fd4b9e6a25767a247b1ad25d78\"},\"parent_equity_cny\":\"251253594419.50\",\"pending_model_choice\":\"B_CONTINUITY_ALTERNATIVE\",\"pending_model_limits\":[\"有限提案计算保留旧财务基准；完整待审包实际生成日更新，不声称历史PIT或完整当前事件准入。\",\"增长、成本、期限是假设；B为低置信研究候选，未获模型、材料性或G3批准。\",\"三档同时改变增长、成本和衰减，不是统计置信区间；终段利润可能倒序。\",\"合并权益不等于母公司可分配现金；金融损失和维护投入上界未知。\",\"当前NO_ACTION，无价格准入和私人仓位；不替换登记研究或正式Excel。\"],\"period_end\":\"2026-06-30\",\"profit_adjustment_research\":{\"action\":\"no_order\",\"additional_parent_n