      {
        "artifact_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
        "identity": {
          "scope_type": "security",
          "scope_key": "600519",
          "artifact_type": "decision_recommendation",
          "schema_version": "c3-v1",
          "as_of": "2026-10-11",
          "available_at": "2026-10-11T08:21:50.762534+00:00"
        },
        "canonical_payload": "{\"action\":\"no_order\",\"blockers\":[\"仅认可历史财务与条件剩余收益范围；中性主估值、正常化盈利及金融尾部审阅未获准入\",\"本候选优势期和全资本衰减未获主模型批准\",\"原文独立解释已形成；重大性、当前模型有效性和估值批准仍未准入\",\"pending_economic_model_review\",\"pending_complete_event_materiality_review\",\"G3_估值门\",\"等待已验证收盘行情\",\"price_bridge_pending_external_data\",\"Selected finite model assumptions remain pending economic approval.\",\"research_case:仅认可历史财务与条件剩余收益范围；中性主估值、正常化盈利及金融尾部审阅未获准入\",\"research_case:本候选优势期和全资本衰减未获主模型批准\",\"research_case:原文独立解释已形成；重大性、当前模型有效性和估值批准仍未准入\",\"research_case:pending_economic_model_review\",\"research_case:pending_complete_event_materiality_review\",\"research_case_valuation_not_approved\",\"valuation_status_not_approved_for_research\",\"model_validity_unavailable\",\"event_materiality_review_unavailable\",\"decision_dependency_artifacts_unavailable\",\"predecision_eligibility_unavailable\",\"human_research_approval_not_resolved\"],\"confidence\":\"低\",\"counter_evidence\":[{\"evidence_refs\":[\"assumption_diagnostic\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"现有假设诊断将路径限定为强衰减压力情景，不能代替中性主估值。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"cninfo:1225475868\"],\"kind\":\"fact\",\"text\":\"扣非TTM使用年报加本期半年报减上年同期；不是跨周期正常化盈利批准。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"cninfo:1225431263\",\"independent-announcement-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"fact\",\"text\":\"7月18日限定产品渠道提价在H1期末之后，前瞻盈利影响尚未量化。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"cninfo:1225475863\",\"cninfo:1225475868\",\"independent-announcement-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"财务公司存款与合并现金流不能直接视为普通股可分配现金；分配假设仍未批准。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"profit-adjustment-bridge-20261008\",\"profit-adjustment-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"非经常性归母桥已对平，扣非基准不能再扣同一金融收益；信用减值本期为正利润贡献，以前期间所得税调整为净利增益，逐项税后归母及重叠仍未知。税桥打印分项与披露合计差0.01元，原数与差额均保留。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"parent-distribution-capital-bridge-20261008\",\"parent-distribution-capital-research-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"H1母公司现金及等价物下降234.75亿元，期初847.31亿元、期末612.56亿元；已执行派息350.33亿元及回购28.80亿元分别核对，不把库存股注销再算现金支出。历史现金缓冲不能证明未来75%派息；两只基金未实缴合计60亿元，付款时点未知。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"operating-mechanism-evidence-20261008\",\"operating-mechanism-research-20261008\",\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"cninfo:1225475868\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"H1成本同比+21.81%高于营收+1.47%，合并毛利率下降1.7441个百分点；FY销售费率4.2961%高于比较期3.2998%。收入韧性没有自动变成利润增长。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"operating-mechanism-evidence-20261008\",\"operating-mechanism-research-20261008\",\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"cninfo:1225475868\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"FY直营收入+12.96%而直营成本+31.07%，披露直营毛利率下降0.75个百分点；H1预收款下降60.31%含营销和预付款政策变化，既不能用渠道迁移证明增量需求，也不能将预收下降机械当成需求崩塌。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"forward-path-independent-review-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"独立重算确认：后五年全资本ROE衰减使第五年利润再下降52.65%/65.84%/75.35%，不是仅新增资本低回报；75%分配只适用于显式十年，终端实际约74.03%/70.40%/65.60%。压力路径不能用作中性合理价。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"financial-scope-independent-review-20261008\"],\"kind\":\"interpretation\",\"text\":\"受限准备金两表期末/期初分别差349.29万元/370.98万元，原因未识别；原值分别保留，不重复扣现金，不能据此认证精确可分配自由现金。财务范围认可只支持历史及条件研究，不批准金融尾部、未来分配或中性主估值。\"},{\"evidence_refs\":[\"pending-economic-proposal\"],\"kind\":\"hypothesis\",\"text\":\"毛利和扣非已走弱；财报不证明十年稳定盈利，全资本衰减仍未分账识别。\"}],\"current_price\":null,\"decision_as_of\":\"2026-10-11\",\"decision_dependency_refs\":[{\"artifact_id\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\",\"artifact_type\":\"research_case\",\"payload_sha256\":\"cc618580d496ff7d3fd95ed5863f101390bcdf8dae740372318ab53a6c5b408b\",\"role\":\"research_case\",\"scope_key\":\"600519\",\"scope_type\":\"security\"},{\"artifact_id\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002\",\"artifact_type\":\"financial_facts\",\"payload_sha256\":\"6c0942628927273bedeae43862134b41bcded3a0c6421044a0c077846ef2e0d2\",\"role\":\"financial_facts\",\"scope_key\":\"600519\",\"scope_type\":\"security\"},{\"artifact_id\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003\",\"artifact_type\":\"research_gate\",\"payload_sha256\":\"848d6392a64675221f5428e67d24b8be4eea1d130b006294cab79c7e963698c8\",\"role\":\"research_gate\",\"scope_key\":\"600519\",\"scope_type\":\"security\"},{\"artifact_id\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004\",\"artifact_type\":\"valuation_assumptions\",\"payload_sha256\":\"c63ab1e7ea8fb8dcbc895147d45f475ace8875860e095ed76f44ef3de17a34a2\",\"role\":\"valuation_assumptions\",\"scope_key\":\"600519\",\"scope_type\":\"security\"},{\"artifact_id\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005\",\"artifact_type\":\"valuation_result\",\"payload_sha256\":\"71c8c8063285ea016ca0574231ecf744529b66cbfddeb692c5620a89c6ac297c\",\"role\":\"valuation\",\"scope_key\":\"600519\",\"scope_type\":\"security\"},{\"artifact_id\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006\",\"artifact_type\":\"price_bridge\",\"payload_sha256\":\"378e0fd4603d39d6d5ef54188fccc06ceab55ad5f75f3990be2ce0e2f8bfdab1\",\"role\":\"price_bridge\",\"scope_key\":\"600519\",\"scope_type\":\"security\"},{\"artifact_id\":\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007\",\"artifact_type\":\"price_attractiveness\",\"payload_sha256\":\"79079fda7ffb29e83d152c6f0a3cd48af85e1d5db703157a8cf301b93aafcbb0\",\"role\":\"price_attractiveness\",\"scope_key\":\"600519\",\"scope_type\":\"security\"}],\"decision_input_sha256\":\"86c5d18edcd0f4277a0a04cc11de3ec5571fba324a8cdeb923b5f2bad89c3ad0\",\"entry_id\":null,\"entry_zone\":null,\"evidence_refs\":[{\"availability_basis\":\"date_only_conservative_next_day_bound\",\"available_at\":\"2026-04-17T16:00:00+00:00\",\"id\":\"cninfo:1225114741\",\"path\":\"runtime/historical-filing-index/20260909T033444358365Z/pdfs/600519-1225114741.pdf\",\"sha256\":\"474905deeaf0f875fc0a1b097a626c0c7852c427faadc5d7fc7816cbf45ea288\",\"source_url\":\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-04-17/1225114741.PDF\",\"timestamp_precision\":\"date\"},{\"availability_basis\":\"date_only_conservative_next_day_bound\",\"available_at\":\"2026-08-15T16:00:00+00:00\",\"id\":\"cninfo:1225475868\",\"path\":\"runtime/historical-filing-index/20260909T033444358365Z/pdfs/600519-122547586